# 统一换行：仓库里存 LF，检出时按平台/类型还原。
# Windows 脚本必须 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析 .bat 时会在某些环境下报错。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.sh  text eol=lf

# 二进制：不要做文本转换，也不要让 diff 把体积算进去
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.so   binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.wav  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico  binary

# 生成的产物：GitHub 语言统计里不该算成源码
frontend/dist/**  linguist-generated=true
backend/web/static/** linguist-generated=true
